{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1d3ba326-32f5-895c-a09a-252f7da9dbe9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:25:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, hello, this is Judith Brownell. I'm calling for my mother. You'll have to forgive me, I'm a little hard of hearing, so I may talk loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no trouble at all, Judith. What's going on with your mother?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Her recycling bin got left at the curb with a tag on it. It says rejected. Rejected! I don't know what was wrong with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a rejected tag on the recycling bin. Did the tag say a reason? Usually there's a box checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What was that? A reason? Hold on, I have it here. It's got a checkmark by something about wrong items. Plastic bags, I think. Bags inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Plastic bags inside the bin. That's a common one. Bags have to stay out of the recycling, and everything goes in loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loose. All right. Is there a fee for that? For being rejected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no fee for a rejected tag. You just take the bags out and put it back out on the next pickup day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. That's a relief. I have to run, I take my grandchildren to library story time and we're headed out in a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds nice. So, no bags, loose items only, and set it out on the next collection day. With the snow and rain today, pickup may run a bit behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Behind, yes, I figured. Thank you very much, dear. Goodbye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Judith. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
